nts the corresponding no-port runtime contract.\n   214\t\n   215\tThe local ope
rations stack (`docker-compose.yml`) MUST keep the\n   216\tPostgres-only integr
ation-test workflow available while also\n   217\tversioning an opt-in `control-
plane` profile for `yalla-api` and\n   218\t`yalla-worker`. The Postgres image i
